Make InlineCacheCompiler.h self-contained when the JIT is on.

The header returns `CCallHelpers::Jump` and `CCallHelpers::JumpList` from
static member functions of `InlineCacheCompiler`, which needs the complete
type, but only forward-declares it. A translation unit that reaches the
header before `CCallHelpers.h` (here `llint/LLIntOffsetsExtractor.cpp`, built
with `ENABLE_JIT=ON` and not part of a unified source) fails with "incomplete
type named in nested name specifier". WebKitGTK 2.54.1 as released.

--- a/Source/JavaScriptCore/bytecode/InlineCacheCompiler.h
+++ b/Source/JavaScriptCore/bytecode/InlineCacheCompiler.h
@@ -30,3 +30,4 @@
 #include "AccessCase.h"
+#include "CCallHelpers.h"
 #include "InlineCacheHandler.h"
 #include "JITStubRoutine.h"
